{"m":"places-people-1.0","g":"2026-10-15","x":{"votes":"Who votes. Residents include children, non-citizens and people who are not registered; a district's people are not its electorate.","year":"This year's population. The count is as of April 1, 2020, the day the lines were drawn on; the survey figures are five-year averages centred on 2022.","exact":"Exactness. Every survey figure has a margin (±); a small district's margins are wide, and two districts whose margins overlap may not differ at all.","fair":"Fairness or intent. Equal population is a legal requirement, and a spread inside the range courts accept is not a finding of fairness, nor one outside it a finding of wrongdoing; the courts weigh the reasons. Nothing here says who was placed where, or why.","adjusted":"Adjusted counts. Some states draw their lines on a count adjusted for where people in prison lived before; the Bureau's count here is unadjusted, so those states' districts look less equal than under the count they used."},"src":[{"f":"2020_UA_COUNTY.xlsx","u":"https://www2.census.gov/geo/docs/reference/ua/2020_UA_COUNTY.xlsx","s":"74f0fc65c2945d33198c75431852e552832cc018c949fcd9230eb5f79959e0b2","d":"2026-10-15","w":"2020 Census urban and rural counts by county"},{"f":"SLDU2024_UR_POPAREA.txt","u":"https://www2.census.gov/geo/docs/maps-data/data/rel2020/cd-sld/SLDU2024_UR_POPAREA.txt","s":"6a1505f73176acd4217dc9f32ad7aeafdde63e29fdfdce9e6e621e1579fb58d0","d":"2026-09-24","w":"2020 Census counts by 119th Congress and 2024 state legislative district"},{"f":"SLDL2024_UR_POPAREA.txt","u":"https://www2.census.gov/geo/docs/maps-data/data/rel2020/cd-sld/SLDL2024_UR_POPAREA.txt","s":"151d28a68624b2d1e0a49e4742ce21626d51dd2636659fd906c14eb6b64516f1","d":"2026-09-24","w":"2020 Census counts by 119th Congress and 2024 state legislative district"},{"f":"Geos20245YR.txt","u":"https://www2.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/summary_file/2024/table-based-SF/documentation/Geos20245YR.txt","s":"b87a1d1a4db9f826d0d13